  ('mla-3-1-1', 'user-default', 'goal-aws', 'Skill 3.1.1: Select appropriate compute environments and deployment targets.', 'Domain 3: Deployment & Orchestration of ML & AI Workflows', 'Medium', 'https://docs.aws.amazon.com/sagemaker/latest/dg/realtime-endpoints.html', 20, FALSE, NULL, NULL, '2026-11-14T14:47:00.125Z', 'Task 3.1: Manage deployment infrastructure for ML and AI model types', FALSE, 'Skill 3.1.1 focuses on: ''Select appropriate compute environments and deployment targets.''. In modern enterprise machine learning and generative AI architectures, this topic forms the backbone of Task ...', 'Exam Tip: Real-time (<10ms, steady traffic); Serverless (spiky/infrequent, zero-cost idle); Asynchronous (large payloads up to 1GB, long runtimes, S3 queuing); Batch Transform (bulk offline datasets). Gotcha: Using Real-Time Endpoints for large payload inputs (>6MB) or long-running inferences (>60s). Real-time endpoints time out at 60 seconds and max 6MB payload; use Asynchronous Endpoints (up to 1GB payload, 1-hour processing).'),
